<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2 CO - Rufumbira New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 ABAKORINTO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Kor</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 ABAKORINTO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Urwandiko rwa kabiri Intumwa Pawulo yandikiye ABAKORINTO</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 ABAKORINTO</para>
  <para style="imt">INYANZURO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Urwandiko rwa Kabiri Intumwa Pawulo yandikiye Abakorinto</char> rwanditswe mu bihe bikomeye ubwo imibaanire ya Pawulo n'itoorero ry'i Korinto yari itameze neeza. Haari abakristo baahakanyaga Pawulo kumugaragaro, ariko Pawulo we akabeereka ko yiifuuza kwiyuzuza na bo kandi agaragaza uko yaneezeerewe bibaaye bityo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu gice ca mbere c'uru rwandiko, Pawulo yiibanda ku kuvuga ubumwe bwe n'itoorero ry'i Korinto. Asobaanura igituma yarasubije arakaye caane ibyo baamututse kandi ahakanya ab'iryo toorero. Pawulo agaragaza umuneezeero yuuko uko kuraakara kwabaazaniye kwihana no kwiyuzuza. Ni ko guheerako asaba itoorero kwitanga bagafasha imbabare zo mu toorero ry'i Yudeeya. Mu bice biheruuka, Pawulo yandika ahamya iby'umuhamagaro we nk'intumwa ya Yesu Kristo, ibi yabivuze ahakanya abantu bake bo mu toorero ry'i Korinto baari baariishizeho biyita ko ari bo ntumwa nyakuri, bakavuga yuuko Pawulo we atari intumwa by'ukuri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ibirimo</para>
  <para style="io1">Inyanzuro <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ibya Pawulo hamwe n'itoorero ry'i Korinto <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:12-7:16">1:12—7:16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gufasha Itoorero ry'i Korinto <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1—9:15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulo Ahamya Ububaasha bwe nk'Intumwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:10">10:1—13:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Umusoozo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 13:11-13">13:11-13</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Indamutso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:1">Iby 18:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Njeewe Pawulo, wagizwe intumwa ya Yesu Kristo ku bw'ubushaake bw'Imaana, hamwe na mwene daata Timoteeyo, turabandikira mwebwe ab'itoorero ry'Imaana riri i Korinto n'abantu b'Imaana boose bari muri Akaya hoose.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Nimugire ubuntu n'amahoro biva ku Maana Daata hamwe n'Umwami Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Ashiima Imaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Dushiime Imaana, Se w'Umwami waacu Yesu Kristo, ari we Daata wa twese w'imbabazi n'ihuumure, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />uduhuumuriza mu makuba yoose, kugira ngo naatwe dushobore guhuumuriza abandi boose bashavuye, tubahuumuriza nk'uko Imaana iduhuumuriza. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Bityo reero nk'uko dusangira na Kristo imibabaro ye yoose bihebuuje, ni na ko Imaana itugezaho guhuumurizwa bihebuuje muri Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Igihe tubabazwa, tubabazwa kugira ngo muhuumurizwe kandi mubone agakiza, kandi iyo duhuumurijwe, ni ukugira ngo namwe muhuumurizwe maze muhaabwe imbaraga zo kwihangaanira imibabaro yo natwe twihangaanira. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Ibyiringiro tubafitemo bitanyeganyezwa nuuko tuuzi ko ubwo dusangiye imibabaro, dusangiye no guhuumurizwa.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Kor 15:32</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bavandimwe, ntitwabahisha amakuba twanyuzemo turi muri Asiya. Uko twababaye bikabije, tukageza n'aho kwiheba tuuzi ngo tugiiye gupfa. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Nibyo koko, twumvaga yuuko duciiriwe urwo gupfa. Ariko ibi byabaaye kugira ngo twekwihanga amaaso ngo twiyiringire, ahuubwo twiringire Imaana yo izuura abaapfuuye. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ni yo yaturokoye ituvaana muri ibyo byago bikomeye, kandi iracaanadukiza. Muri yo niho dushingiye ibyiringiro byacu ko izongera ikadukiza, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />kandi twizeeye yuuko namwe mudufasha mukadusabira. Bityo reero ku bw'amasengeesho y'abantu benshi, Imaana ikaduha imigisha maze bigatuma benshi bayishiimira ku bwacu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Asubika Uruzinduko rwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Tuneezeezwa nuuko umutima waacu uhamya yuuko ubugingo bwacu ku isi, na caane imibaanire yaacu namwe yashobojwe no kwera kutaryarya kuva ku Maana, bidateewe n'ubwenge bw'abantu, ahuubwo biteewe n'ubuntu bw'Imaana. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Ntitubandikira ibirenze ibyo mwashobora gusoma mugasobaanukirwa, kandi niizeera ko muri busobaanukirwe ibi kugeza ku musoozo, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />n'ubwo ubu mudasobaanukiwe, kugira ngo kuri wa munsi Umwami Yesu azaazira, tuzaabiiraatane nk'uko namwe mutwiraatiisha.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Kuko nari niiringiye ibi reero, nagize umugambi wo kubanza kuuza kubasuura kugira ngo Imaana ikubiishemo kabiri ku migisha ibaha. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Iby 19:21</ref>.</char></note>Nashaakaga kuuza kubasuura nkija i Makedooniya, ngo kandi nongere ngaruke mvuye i Makedooniya kugira ngo mumpe n'ubufasha bunshoboza gukomeza urugendo nja i Yudeeya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Mbese ubwo nendaga gukora ntyo, narashidiikanyaga? Cangwa se mwibwira ko iyo nkora imigambi nshingira ku rugero rw'abantu, mu buryo niihakanya nkavuga nti, “Yeego, yeego,” cangwa nti, “Oya, oya,” mbivugira icaarimwe? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Nk'uko Imaana ari iyo kwizeerwa, ni yo njuriza yuuko tutiigeze tubajijiisha ngo tubabwire ngo, “Yeego” na “oya”. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Iby 18:5</ref>.</char></note>Kuko Yesu Kristo Umwana w'Imaana uwo nje na Siluwano hamwe na Timoteeyo twababwirije atiivugurura ngo yihakane ibyo yari yiyemeje, ahuubwo muri we harimo “Yeego” gusa. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Kuko muri we Imaana yuzuza amaseezerano yaayo. Ni yo mpamvu Yesu Kristo ari we “Amiina” kugira ngo Imaana ihaabwe ikuzo. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Ni yo idukomereza mu kwizeera Kristo hamwe namwe kandi ni yo Yadutooranyije ngo dukore umurimo waayo, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />idushiraho ikimenyeetso, iduha Umwuka waayo mu mitima yaacu kugira ngo utubeere icemezo c'ibyiza yatugeneye.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Imaana ni yo njuriza yuuko icaatumye ntongera kuuza i Korinto ari uko ntaashaatse kubongera imibabaro. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Icakora ntitubahata ku byerekeye ukwizeera kwanyu kuko tuuzi neeza yuuko mugushikamyemo, ahuubwo dukorana namwe kugira ngo mugire kwishiima.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Noone niiyemeje kutagaruka iwaanyu ngo ntongera kubateera agahinda. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Mbese mbateeye agahinda, ni nde wanteera umuneezeero? Ni abo bo nateeye agahinda. <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ni co gituma narabandikiye urwandiko ntyo, kugira ngo ninza nteeguteezwa agahinda n'abo baakabaaye banteera umuneezeero. Kuko niiringira ko umuneezeero wanje ari wo muneezeero waanyu. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Kuko nabandikiye mfite agahinda gasaaze, umutima wanje wuuzuye umubabaro kandi ndira, atari ukugira ngo namwe mbateeze gushavura, ahuubwo ngo mumenye yuuko mbafitiye urukundo ruhebuuje.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubabarirana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Niiba hari umuntu wagize uwo ateera agahinda, si nje yababaje gusa ahuubwo namwe yarabababaje mu buryo butari bumwe. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Igihano abenshi muri mwe baamuhannye kirahaagije ku muntu nk'uwo. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Noone reero ubu mumubabarire kandi mumuhuumurize, kugira ngo ataaza kwicwa n'agahinda gasaaze. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Kandi ndabinginze, mumwereke urukundo mumufitiye. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Nabandikiye mbagerageza kugira ngo menye niiba mwumvira muri byose. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Umuntu weese wo muzaababarira nanje nzaamubabarira. Kuko iyo mbabarira, niiba koko hari ico nkwiriye kugirira imbabazi, mba mbabarira ku bwanyu imbere ya Kristo, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />kugira ngo tweguha Sataani umwanya wo kutuguusha kuko tuuzi imigambi ye.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Ahagarika Umutima ari i Tirowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:1">Iby 20:1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ubwo nageze i Tirowa kwamamaza Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo, nasanze Umwami waacu yaranteguuriye uburyo. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Ariko nahangayikiishijwe n'uko ntaasanzeyo mwene daata Tito. Nuuko mpeerako ndabaseezera nja i Makedooniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo Adushoboza Gutsinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Ariko Imaana ishimwe kuko ishoboza Kristo guhora atuja imbere mu kwizihiza intsinzi. Ni yo ituma twamamaza hoose impuumuro nziiza izanwa no kumumenya. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Kuko turi nk'imibavu ihuumura neeza Kristo atuura Imaana, ikagera kuri abo bakizwa hamwe n'abarimbuka. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Kuri abo barimbuka, tubanuukira nk'urupfu rubiica, ariko kuri abo bakizwa, ni impumuro nziiza ibaazanira ubuzima. Mbese ni nde waashobora gukora umurimo nk'uyu? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Ariko twe ntitumeze nk'abagenda bacuruuza ijambo ry'Imaana nk'aho ari umukimbo uciiriritse, ahuubwo kuko Imaana ari yo yadutumye, tuvuga tutaryarya imbere yaayo kandi nk'abakozi ba Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Abaheereza b'Iseezerano Risha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Mbese muteekereza yuuko dutangiye kongera kwishiimagiza? Cangwa se ko dukeneye kwitwaza inzandiko zitwanzura kuri mwe cangwa zibavuuyeho nk'uko bamwe babigenza? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Urwandiko rwacu rwanditswe mu mitima yaacu ni mwe, uru rwandiko rugomba kumenywa kandi rugasomwa na boose. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Biragaragara yuuko ari mwe rwandiko rwa Kristo twateguuye, rutanditswe n'ikaraamu ahuubwo rwanditswe n'Umwuka w'Imaana, kandi rutanditswe ku mpapuro ahuubwo rwanditswe ku mitima y'abantu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Ico ni co ciizeere dufite mu Maana tubikeesha Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Yuuko ubwacu tutiihaagije ngo twiraate ko hari ico twakwishoboza ahuubwo ubushobozi bwacu buva ku Maana, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />ari yo idushoboza kuba abaheereza bo mu seezerano risha, ridashingiye ku nzandiko z'amategeko ahuubwo rishingiye ku Mwuka. Kuko amategeko ariica, naho Umwuka ugatanga ubugingo.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ayo mategeko yari inyuguti zanditswe ku bisate by'amabuye, ariko ikuzo ry'Imaana ryaragaragaye rirabagirana igihe yatangwaga ku buryo no ku maaso ha Moose haararabagiranye. Ryarabagiranaga bihebuuje ku buryo bitashobokaga ngo Abiisirayeli bakomeze kureeba Moose. Niiba reero amategeko azanira abantu gupfa iyo adakurikijwe yarazanye n'iryo kuzo rihebuuje rityo, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />ikuzo ry'imirimo y'Umwuka ryo rizaaba rimeze rite? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Noone niiba amategeko azana guciibwaho iteeka yarahaawe ikuzo, imirimo izanira abantu agakiza yo izaahabwa ikuzo rihebuje kurutaho! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ni koko amategeko yataakaje ikuzo ryayo kuko haabonetse igifite ikuzo risumbaho. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Kuko niiba haari ikuzo ku mategeko yamaze akaanya gato akoreeshwa, ico kigenewe kubaho iteeka co kizaagira ikuzo riheebuje kurutaho.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Nooneho ubwo dufite ico ciizeere, biduteera kuvuga dushize amanga. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Ntitumeze nka Moose wiitwikiiraga igitambaaro ku maaso kugira ngo Abiisirayeli batareeba ikuzo rimushiraho. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Nyamara imitima yaabo yariinangiye, no kugeza ubu ca gitambaaro kiracaatwikiiriye ku maaso haabo iyo basomerwa iseezerano rya keera. Ico gitambaaro gitwikurwa no kwizeera Kristo byonyine. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />No kugeza kuri uyu munsi, iyo ibyanditswe na Moose bisomwa, ico gitambaaro gitwikiira ibiteekerezo byabo. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Ariko iyo umuntu ahindukiye Umwami ico gitambaaro kiratwikuurwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Umwami uvugwaho ni Umwuka, kandi aho Umwuka w'Umwami ari haba umudendeezo. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Nuuko reero twese twerekana ikuzo ry'Umwami kandi amaaso yaacu aratwikuuruye. Iryo kuzo riva ku Mwami waacu ni wo Mwuka uduhindura ngo duse na we, tuva ku rwego rumwe rw'ikuzo tuja ku rundi.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ubutunzi bw'Umwuka mu Ibumba Rimeneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nuuko reero ubwo twahaawe gukora uyu murimo ku bw'imbabazi z'Imaana, ntiduciika intege. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Twanga ibiteeye isoni bikorwa rwihishwa, ntitugendera mu buriganya kandi ntitugoreka ijambo ry'Imaana, ahuubwo tuvuga ukuri tweruye imbere y'Imaana kugira ngo buri muntu weese amenye mu mutima we ko turi abanyakuri. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Kandi niiba Ubutumwa Bwiza tuvuga butwikiiriwe, butwikiiririwe abarimbuka. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Ntibeemera kuko imaana mbi itegeka iyi isi yatwikiirije imitima yaabo umwijima. Niyo ituma batabona umuco ubamurikaho, uwo muco ariwo uva mu Butumwa Bwiza bw'ikuzo rya Kristo, ari we shusho ry'Imaana nyaaryo. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Erega ntituba twiyamamaza ahuubwo twamamaza Yesu Kristo ko ari we Mwami naho twe tukaba abagaragu baanyu kubwa Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Kuko Imaana yategetse ngo, “Umuco ni umurike mu mwijima,” ni yo Maana yatumye umuco waayo umurikira mu mitima yaacu ukatuuzanira kumenya ikuzo ry'Imaana rimurikira mu maaso ya Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Icakora twebwe tumeze nk'ababiitse ubwo butunzi mu ibumba rimeneka, kugira ngo ububaasha buhebuuje budukorerwamo bwekutwitirirwa, ahuubwo bumenywe ko buturuka ku Maana. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Tubabazwa mu buryo bwose ariko ntidushenjagurwa, turashoberwa ariko ntitwiheba, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />turatootezwa ariko Imaana ntiiduteererana, dukubitwa haasi, ariko ntidutsindwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Igihe coose tugendana imibabaro y'urupfu rwa Kristo, kugira ngo ubuzima bwe bugaragarire mu mibiri yaacu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />N'ubwo turi bazima, duhora turi mu kaaga ko kwicwa tuzizwa Yesu Kristo, kugira ngo ubuzima bwe bubonekere mu mibiri yaacu izaapfa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Bityo, twe duhora dutezwe n'urupfu, naho mwe mukazaabiboneramo ubugingo bw'iteeka.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ariko dushigikiwe n'umutima wo kwizeera nk'uko ibyanditswe bivuga ngo, “Nariizeeye, niyo mpamvu mbyamamaza,” natwe uko kwizeera niko gutuma twamamaza ubutumwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Tuuzi yuuko Imaana yazuuye Umwami Yesu izaatuzuurana na we, kandi ikatujaana hamwe na mwe ituuzana imbere ye. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ibi byose biba ku bwanyu, kugira ngo ubuntu bw'Imaana bugwire muri benshi, bitume bashiima Imaana kandi bayiheeshe ikuzo.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubeeshwaho no Kwizeera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Ni co gituma tudaciika intege. N'ubwo umubiri waacu ugenda usaaza, imitima yaacu yo ihora ihindurwa busha buri munsi. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Kandi uku kubabazwa kw'akaanya gato muri iki gihe gihita kugenewe kuduteguurira ikuzo ry'iteeka rihebuuje tuzaabona ritagereranywa n'amakuba tunyuramo ubu. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Kuko ntiduhanga amaaso yaacu kubigaragara ahuubwo twibanda kubitagaragara, kuko ibigaragara ari iby'akaanya gato, naho ibitagaragara n'iby'iteeka ryose.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Tuuzi yuuko uyu mubiri ducumbitsemo kuri iyi si ari nk'ihema, ni rizaasenywa, Imaana idufitiye inzu mu ijuru idasenyuka, itaaruubatswe n'amaboko y'abantu kandi ihoraho iteeka. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Igihe tugicumbitse muri iryo hema turatakamba, tukiifuuza kwambikwa imibiri misha ihoraho yo mu ijuru <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />kugira ngo nitumara kwamburwa uyu mubiri wo ku isi, tudasangwa twambaye ubusa. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Tugicumbitse muri iri hema ryo ku isi, dutaka ku bw'imibabaro ituremeerereye. Si uko twifuuza kwamburwa uyu mubiri, ahuubwo ni uko twifuuza kwambikwa umubiri tuzaahaabwa mu ijuru, kugira ngo uyu upfa usimbuurwe n'udapfa. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Imaana ni yo yaduteguuriye ibyo, iduha Umwuka waayo nk'ikimenyeetso c'umushingo uhamya ko izaabisohoza.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Bityo tukagira ubutwari, tuuzi yuuko iyo turi mu mubiri wo kuri iyi si, tuba dutuuye kure y'Umwami waacu. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Kuko tugenda tuyoborwa no kwizeera, ntituyoborwa n'ibigaragarira amaaso. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Ni koko duhora dushikamye, kandi tukarushaho gukunda ko twakwitandukanya n'uyu mubiri kugira ngo twibaanire n'Umwami waacu Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ni co gituma tugamije kumushiimiisha twaba turi aha ku isi cangwa tutayirimo. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:10">Rom 14:10</ref>.</char></note>Kuko twese tuziitaba imbere ya Kristo guciirwa urubanza, kugira ngo buri umwe ahaabwe ibikwiriye ibyo yakoze akiri ku isi, byaba byiza cangwa bibi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo ni we Muhuuza Waacu n'Imaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Ubu tuuzi gutiinya Nyagasani ico ari co, ni yo mpamvu dukora uko dushoboye ngo ibye tubyemeze abantu. Uko turi koose Imaana iratuuzi, kandi niiringira yuuko namwe ibyacu mubiizi neeza mu mutima. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Ibi simbivuga kugira ngo nongere kubiiyererutsaho, ahuubwo turashaaka kubaha uburyo bwo kuturaata, kugira ngo mubone ico musubiza ba bandi baraata ibigaragarira amaaso bidafite ishingiro mu mutima. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Niiba twarasaze, twasaze ku bw'Imaana, kandi niiba turi bazima, ni mwe bifitiye akamaro. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Duhatwa n'urukundo rwa Kristo, kuko twemera yuuko umwe yapfiiriye boose, ni na ko reero boose baapfuuye. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Koko yapfiiriye boose, kugira ngo ababaho, bekubaho ku bwabo, ahuubwo babeho ku bw'uwo wabapfiiriye akanabazuukira.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Ni co gituma uheereye ubu reero ari ntaamuntu n'umwe tukireeba ngo tumubare dushingiye kuri kamere muntu, n'ubwo na Kristo twigeze kumureeba dukurikije kamere muntu, ubu nti tukimureeba dutyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Bityo reero niiba umuntu weese yiizeeye Kristo, aba agizwe icaaremwe gisha. Ibya keera byose biba bishize. Dore byose biba bihindutse bisha! <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Ibyo byose biva ku Maana, yo yiyunze naatwe inyuriye muri Kristo, ikaduha umurimo wo guhuuza abandi bantu na yo. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Kuko Imaana yanyuriye muri Kristo kugira ngo yiiyunge n'abo ku isi boose, ntiyababaraho ibicumuro byabo. Noone naatwe ni ko idushinga ubutumwa bwo guhuuza Imaana n'abantu.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Ubu reero turi intumwa za Kristo, kuko Imaana idukoreesha kubagezaho ubutumwa. Nuuko reero turabinginga mu izina rya Kristo, ngo mwiyuzuze n'Imaana. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kristo utaarigeze akora icaaha, Imaana yamubazeho ibyaha by'abantu, kugira ngo muri we tubone kuba intungaane imbere y'Imaana.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Ubwo dukorana n'Imaana, turabinginga kugira ngo mwegupfuusha ubusa ubuntu bwayo. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Kuko iravuga iti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Mu gihe gikwiriye, narakumviise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">ku munsi w'agakiza, naragutabaaye.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Noone reero, dore, iki ni co gihe gikwiriye, uyu ni wo munsi wo gukirizwamo!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Twirinda gushira igisiitaaza mu nzira y'umuntu weese, kugira ngo umurimo dukora utagira umugayo. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Ahuubwo mu byo dukora byose, tugerageza kwerekana yuuko turi abagaragu b'Imaana, mu kwihangaanira caane amakuba, imibabaro n'ibyago. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Iby 16:23</ref>.</char></note>Twarakubiswe, turafungwa, duteerwa n'imidugararo, dukora ubudatuuza, turaara tudasinziiriye ndetse dushonje, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />muri ibyo byose turangwa n'ubuziranenge, ubwenge, kwihangaana, n'ineeza, tuyobowe n'Umwuka Weera tukagira urukundo nyakuri. <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Twamamaza ubutumwa bw'ukuri, tuyobowe n'imbaraga z'Imaana. Dufite intwaro yo gukiraanuka ari yo turwaniisha kandi ikaba ingabo idukingira. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Turuubahwa kandi tukagawa, baradusebya kandi bakadushiimagiza, batwita ababeeshi kandi turi abanyakuri, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />dusa nk'intamenyekana, kandi tuuzwi neeza, dusa nk'abagiiye gupfa kandi turi bazima, dusa nk'abahanwa ariko ntitwicwe. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Duteerwa agahinda ariko tugahorana ibyishiimo, dusa nk'abakene ariko tugakenuura benshi, dusa nk'abatagira ico bafite ariko nyamara dufite byose.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Nshuti zaacu z'i Korinto, tubabwije ukuri, tubeeruriye ibiri mu mitima yaacu. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Mu mibaanire yaacu namwe, ntitwigeze kureka kwagura imitima yaacu tubagaragariza urukundo tubafitiye, ahuubwo ni mwe mwanze kudukinguurira imitima yaanyu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ni yo mpamvu reero inteera kuvugana namwe nk'ubwira abaana be ngo, namwe nimwagure imitima yaanyu kugira ngo mutwituure urukundo twabagiriye.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Turi Urusengero rw'Imaana Nzima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ntimukiifatanye n'abatiizeera kandi mudahwanye na bo. Mbese ubukiraanutsi bufite isaano ki n'ubukozi bw'ibibi? Cangwa se, hariho mubaano ki hagati y'umwijima n'umuco? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Mbese Kristo ahuuriye he na Sataani? Cangwa, uwiizeera n'utiizeera bahuuriye kuki? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Kor 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:19">6:19</ref>.</char></note>Mbese Inzu y'Imaana yahuuza ite n'ibigirwamaana? Kuko turi inzu y'Imaana nzima. Nk'uko Imaana yavuze iti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Nzaatuura mu bantu banje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">mbaane na bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">nzaababeera Imaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">Kandi na bo bambeere umuryango.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Ni ko Uhoraho avuga ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“Nimubavemo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">nuuko mwitandukanye na bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Ntihagire ico mukoraho gihumaanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">maze nzaabaakiira.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Nzaababeera umubyeyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">namwe mumbeere abaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">ni ko Uhoraho avuga.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Nshuti bakundwa, ayo maseezerano yoose nitwe yahaawe. Bityo reero ni mureke twiyeze twivaaneho ikintu coose gishobora guhumaanya imibiri n'imitima yaacu, dushiishikarire ubutungaane mu kuubaha Imaana.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Ashiimiishwa n'Uko Abakorinto Biihannye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Natwe nimuduhe umwanya mu mitima yaanyu. Dore ntaamuntu twashobereje, ntaawe twonooneye, nta n'uwo twarimanganyije. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ibi simbivugiye kugira ngo hagire uwo nshinja icaaha, nk'uko nabivuze mbere, tubahoza ku mitima yaacu, niiyo haaba mu rupfu cangwa mubuzima turabaana. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Mbafiteho iciizeere gihaagije, kandi muhora munteera kubiiraatiisha! Mukaaga koose tunyuramo, turahuumurizwa kandi tukagira umuneezeero useesuuye.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 2:13">2 Kor 2:13</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ndetse n'ubwo twageze muri Makedooniya, ntaabwo twigeze turuhuuka na hato, ahuubwo twahuuye n'ingorane hoose, intambara ziva hirya no hiino, hamwe no guhagarika imitima. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ariko Imaana ihuumuriza abaciitse intege, iraduhuumuriza tuboonye Tito aje. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Si ukuuza kwe byonyine byaduhuumurije, ahuubwo n'uko yatubwiye uko mwamukomeje, ibyo bikadusubizamo intege. Yatubwiye n'ukuntu munkumbuye, ishavu mufite, n'uko mwiteguuye kundwanirira, akaba ubu birushaho kuuneezeeza.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Nuubwo urwandiko nabandikiye rwaba rwarabateeye agahinda, siniicuza ko narwanditse. Mba nariicujije mboonye uko rwabateeye agahinda umwanya muto. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Noone ubu mfite umuneezeero, icakora si uko nabateeye agahinda, ahuubwo ni uko ako gahinda kabateeye kwihana. Imaana yakoreesheje ako gahinda, bityo reero twe ntaaco twigeze tubatwara. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Kuko agahinda gateerwa no kuubaha Imaana gakurikirwa no kwihana bikabyara agakiza kandi ibyo ntaawabyicuza! Ariko agahinda gateerwa n'abantu kaazana urupfu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Ni mureebe ibyo Imaana yabakoreye biteewe n'ako gahinda: Ukuntu kaabateeye umwete wo kwisubiraho mukiihana, uko mwashiishikariye gukora ibyiza, ukuntu kuraakara ku bw'ibyabaaye, guhagarika imitima, ibyifuuzo n'ishaka byatumye mwemera guhana uwagize naabi. Muri byose mwagaragaje ko muri abeere mu byabaaye byose.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Nuuko reero n'ubwo nabandikiye urwo rwandiko, sinabiteewe n'uwagize naabi cangwa uwagiriwe naabi. Ahuubwo, narwandikiye kubagaragariza imbere y'Imaana umwete mutugirira. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Ibyo ni byo byadukomeje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Uretse gukomezwa n'ibyo, twashiimiishijwe caane n'umuneezeero Tito yagize mumuhuumurije. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Niiba narabaraase imbere Tito, ntaabwo byigeze binkoza isoni. Ariko nk'uko ibyo twababwiye byose ari ukuri, ni na ko ibyo twanaraatiye Tito ari iby'ukuri. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ni co gituma arushaho kubakunda, iyo yibutse uko mwese mwamwumviye, n'uko mwamwakiiriye mu cuubahiro n'igitinyiro. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Nshimiishijwe n'uko nshobora kubiringira muri byose.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Gutanga Bivuuye ku Mutima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:26">Rom 15:26</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bavandimwe, twifuuza kubamenyeesha ibyerekeye ubuntu bw'Imaana yagiriye amatoorero y'i Makedooniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Mu gihe baageragezwaga banyura mu makuba, baagize umuneezeero uhebuuje ku buryo baagize ubuntu bagatanga caane n'ubwo baari abakene. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ndabahamiriza yuuko baatanze uko bashoboye, ndetse bagatanga ibirenze ibyo bashoboye ku bushaake, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />batwinginga caane ngo tubareke bagire uruhari mu gufasha abantu b'Imaana baari i Yudeeya. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Icakora, ntibaabigenjeje nk'uko twibwiraga, baabanje kwiyegurira Nyagasani, kandi ku bw'ubushaake bw'Imaana, naatwe baratwitangira. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ni co caatumye dusaba Tito kurangiza umurimo w'ubuntu yari yaratangiye muri mwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Ubwo mukora neeza caane muri byose, haaba mu kwizeera, mu kuvuga, mu bwenge, mu gushiishikarira gufasha hamwe no mu rukundo mwatugiriye, abe ari ko murushaho no gushiishikarira kugira umwete w'umurimo wo kugira ubuntu.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ibi simbivugiye kubategeka, ahuubwo ni ukugira ngo menye niiba mufite urukundo nyakuri ngereranyije n'umwete abandi bafite. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Musanzwe muuzi ubuntu Umwami waacu Yesu Kristo yagize, n'ubwo yari umukire, yemeye kwigira umukene ku bwanyu, kugira ngo mu bukene bwe muhinduke abakire.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Inaama naabagiira muri ibyo ni uko byakabaye byiza mukarangiza ubu ibyo mwatangiye umwaka ushize. Mwari aba mbere kugira ibyo mukora, kandi si ibyo byonyine, ahuubwo mwabikoranye ubushaake. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Nuuko kandi mubirangize, kugira ngo nk'uko mwaciiyemeje mufite ubwuzu, noone ari ko mukirangiza, mutange uko mushoboye. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Kuko niiba mufite ubwuzu bwo gutanga, Imaana izaakiira ico utanze ikurikije ibyo ufite, atari ibyo udafite.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Simvuga ntyo kugira ngo mworohereze abandi nuuko mwe muvunike, ahuubwo n'uko haabaho uburinganiza <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />mu gihe mufite byinshi mugaha imbabare, kugira ngo namwe nihazaaba hari ibyo mukennye bazaabibahe bityo hakabaho kunganya. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Nk'uko ibyanditswe bivuga biti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">“Uwari ufite byinshi ntiyagize byinshi caane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 8:15">kandi n'uwari ufite bike ntiyagize bike caane.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tito na Bagenzi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Mbeega ukuntu dushiimira Imaana yahaaye Tito umutima wo kwitaho nk'uko naatwe turi! <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ntaabwo yeemeye gusaba kwacu gusa, ahuubwo yari afite ubwuzu bwo kuuza iwaanyu abikunze. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Tumwohereje n'umuvandimwe ushiimwa n'amatoorero yoose kwamamaza ubutumwa bwiza. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Byongeye kandi, ni we watooranyijwe n'amatoorero kuja ajaana naatwe mu gihe dukora umurimo twashinzwe kugira ngo duheeshe Imaana ubwayo ikuzo kandi no kugaragaza umutima wo dufite wo gutanga ku bushaake.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Twirinda kugira ngo hatagira uduteera urubwa akurikije ibikorwa by'ubuntu tugira. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Ikigendererwa caacu si ugukora ibitungaanye imbere y'Umwami waacu gusa, ahuubwo ni ugukora n'ibitungaanye imbere y'abantu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Noone tubooherereje n'undi mwene daata uwo twagerageje kenshi bikagaragara ko afite umwete muri byinshi, ariko ubu akaba arushaho kugira umwete ku bw'iciizeere abafitiye. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Na ho Tito we, ni mugenzi wanje dufatanya umurimo tubakorera, kandi abo beene daata bo, n'intumwa z'amatoorero ya Kristo bakorera guheesha Kristo ikuzo. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Nuuko reero, nimubagaragarize urukundo kandi mubeereke impamvu ziduteera kubiiraatana.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Gufasha Abandi Bakristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Si ngombwa yuuko mbandikira ibyerekeye imfashanyo igenewe abantu b'Imaana bari i Yudeeya. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Kuko nzi yuuko mufite umuhaati wo gutanga ku bushaake, kandi nkaba narabaraatiye abantu b'i Makedooniya, mvuga uko Abanyakaya bamaze umwaka babiiteguuye, kandi yuuko umuhaati mufite wateeye abantu umwete. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Noone mboherereje beene daata kugira ngo uko kwiraata tubiiraatiisha kwe kuzaapfa ubusa, kandi no kugira ngo mwiteguure nk'uko nababwiye. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Naho ubundi nzanye n'ab'i Makedooniya bagasanga ntaaco mwiteguuye kandi tubafitiye iciizeere, twakorwa n'isoni maze namwe mugahemuka. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Ni co caatumye niibwira yuuko nkwiriye gusaba abo beene daata ngo bambanzirize kuuza iwaanyu, kugira ngo bateguure impaano z'imfashanyo mwiyemeje gutanga, nuuko reero nzaasange mwaranyiteguuye bigaragara yuuko mwatanze mu bikunze atari ku gahato.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Mwibuke yuuko ubiba imbuto nke azaasaaruura bike, kandi ubiba imbuto nyinshi azaasaaruura byinshi. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Buri muntu akwiriye gutanga nk'uko umutima we umwemeza, atiinuubwa kandi adahaswe, kuko Imaana ikunda utanga aneezeerewe. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Kandi Imaana ifite ububaasha bwo kubaha ibyifuuzo byanyu byose, kugira ngo murusheho gukora ibyiza byose mufite ibibahaagije. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Nk'uko byanditswe ngo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Yatanze ku buntu aha abakene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">kugira neeza kwe guhoraho iteeka.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Imaana iha umubibyi imbuto, ikamugaburira ibyokurya ngo bimutunge ni yo izaabaha imbuto zo kubiba izigwize kugira ngo zirumbuuke umusaaruuro wo kugira neeza kwanyu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Izaabagwiriza ubukungu mu buryo bwose kugira ngo mugwize ineeza, izaatuma benshi bashiima Imaana ku bwanyu babidukeesha. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Kuko umurimo wo mukora si uwo gufasha abatooranyijwe n'Imaana byonyine, ahuubwo utuma n'abandi barushaho gushiima Imaana. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Ku bw'ubuhamya bw'uyu murimo mwitangiye, benshi bazaaha Imaana icuubahiro ku bwo mwumviye ubutumwa bwiza bwa Kristo, kandi n'ineeza mwagize mu gusangira na bo hamwe n'abandi boose. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Bityo reero n'urukumbuzi rwinshi barabasengera ku bw'ubuntu bw'Imaana buhebuuje yabagiriye. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Imaana ishiimirwe ubuntu bwayo burenze urugero.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Arengera Ubuheereza Bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Njeewe Pawulo ubwanje ndabinginga ku bw'ubugwaneeza n'ineeza ya Kristo. Ni nje uvugwa ko niyoroheje iyo ndi imbere yaanyu, ariko igihe ntari hamwe namwe nkabakankamira. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ndabinginga kugira ngo mbaaye nje iwaanyu neekuzaahatwa kubabwiza ubukana, kuko nzi neeza yuuko naashobora guhangaara bamwe biibwira yuuko dukurikiza kamere y'abantu. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ni byo koko dufite umubiri w'umuntu ariko ntiturwana nk'abantu, <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />kuko intwaro turwaniisha zitaacuzwe n'abantu, ahuubwo n'intwaro zituruka ku Maana, zikagira imbaraga zo guseenya ibidaseenyuka. Turimbura impaka z'ibinyoma zidafite ishingiro, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />tugahirika ibisiitaaza byose byishira heejuru kurwanya kumenya Imaana, kandi tugafata mpiri ibiteekerezo byose ngo byumvire Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Twiteguuye guhana uwanga kumvira weese nimuba mwumviye mumaramaje.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Mureeba ibintu mushingiye ku bigaragara imbere yaanyu. Niiba hari umuntu muri mwe wiyumvamo ko ari uwa Kristo, niyongere yiyibutse yuuko ari uwa Kristo nk'uko naatwe turi aba Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ubu sibyankoza isoni n'ubwo naakwiraatana ububaasha dufite, ubwo Umwami waacu yaduhaaye kugira ngo tubuubake tutabaseenya. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Sinshaaka yuuko inzandiko zanje zibateera ubwoba. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Kuko bavuga bati, “Inzandiko za Pawulo zivugiisha amagambo akaze kandi akomeye, ariko iyo turi hamwe aba afite intege nke kandi amagambo ye ari ubusa.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Uvuga atyo weese akwiriye kumenya yuuko ibyo tuvuga mu nzandiko tutari hamwe ari na byo tuzaakora turi hamwe.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Ntiduhangaara kwireesheeshanya cangwa kwigereranya n'abo biivuga ho ishiimwe. Nyamara biishiriraho igipimo caabo maze bakiireesheeshanya n'abandi. Iyo bakoze batyo baba beerekana ko ari abapfaapfa. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ariko twe, ntitwiraata birenze urugero, ahuubwo kwiraata kwacu kugarukira ku gukora umurimo Imaana yaduhaaye wo kuvuga ubutumwa kandi ngo namwe tububagezeho. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Noone reero ubwo namwe muri bamwe muri abo tugezaho ubu butumwa, ntitwigeze twiraata ngo turenge urugero ubwo twabaajeho tubaazaniye Inkuru Nziiza ya Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Ntitwiraatiisha imirimo abandi baakoze irenze urugero. Ahuubwo twiringira yuuko kwizeera kwanyu kugiiye kwiyongera nuuko dushobozwe gukora umurimo uhebuuje muri mwe. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Nibwo tuzaamamaza Inkuru Nziiza mu yindi myanya iri hirya yaanyu tutiiraatiisha imirimo yakozwe n'abandi.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Nk'uko ibyanditswe bigira biti, “Ushaaka kwiraata weese, niyiiraatane Nyagasani.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Kuko uwishiima si we ushimwa ahuubwo hashimwa uwashimwe na Nyagasani.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo hamwe n'Intumwa z'Ibinyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Icampa mukihangaanira ubugoryi bwanje ho gato. Nyaabuna nimunyihangaanire! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Mbafuuhira nk'uko Imaana ibafuuhira. Nabaseezeranyije nk'useezeranira umwari w'isugi utegereje gushingirwa ku mugabo umwe rukumbi, ari we Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Ariko mfite ubwoba yuuko muzooshwa mugateeshuka ku gukunda no gutungaanira Kristo nk'uko inzoka yooheje Eva mu mayeri. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Kuko iyo haaje umuntu ubabwira Yesu wundi atari uwo twamamaje, cangwa mukaakiira undi mwuka utari Umwuka w'Imaana mwahaawe, cangwa akabagezaho ubundi butumwa muteemeye, mumwakiira mubikunze.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ndibwira yuuko abo biiyita intumwa z'akataraaboneka ari nta co bandusha. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Nuubwo wenda naaba ntaaratoojwe kuvuga neeza, ariko mfite ubwenge buhaagije, kandi ibyo twabibeeretse mu buryo bwose, no muri byose.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Mbese nakoze icaaha ubwo niiciishije bugufi kugira ngo mushirwe heejuru, ubwo nababwirizaga Inkuru Nziiza y'Imaana ku buntu? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Bireebeka nk'aho nanyagaga andi matoorero ubwo naakiiraga imfashanyo zaabo, kugira ngo mbone uko mbakorera ku buntu. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:15-18">Fil 4:15-18</ref>.</char></note>Ubwo nagiraga ico nkenera igihe nari kumwe namwe, ntaamuntu n'umwe niigeze ndusha ngo ngire ico musaba. Ahuubwo bagenzi banje bo muri Makedooniya ni bo bantabaaye muri ubwo bukene. Niirinze kubarusha, kandi nzaakomeza kubyirinda. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Nshingiye ku kuri kwa Kristo undimo, ntaawe uzambuza kwiraatana ibyo mu bice byo muri Akaya hoose. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Mbese ibyo mbivuze kuko ntabakunda? Imaana ni yo izi uko mbakunda.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Kandi nzaakomeza gukora uko nabigenzaga kugira ngo ntaha umwanya abo bashaaka kwitwara nk'aho bameze nka twe mu byo biiraatana. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Kuko abantu biiraata batyo aba ari intumwa z'ibinyoma, bakorera mu buriganya, biigira nk'intumwa za Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Nyamara, ntaawabagaya kuko na Sataani ubwe yihindura nka malayika w'umuco. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Nuuko reero ntaagitangaaza kihari niiba abaheereza be biihindura bakiyita abaheereza b'ubutungaane. Iheerezo ry'abo rizaahwana n'imirimo yaabo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amakuba ya Pawulo nk'Intumwa ya Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ndongera kubisubiramo, ntihakagire umuntu uteekereza ko ndi umupfaapfa. Ariko reero nimushaaka kubikora, nimunyakiire nk'umupfaapfa kugira ngo mbone uko niiraataho gato. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Ibyo mvuga ubu byerekeye kwiraata ntinyutse, simbibwirijwe na Nyagasani ahuubwo mbiteewe n'ubupfaapfa bwanje. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ubwo benshi biiraatiisha ibikorwa byabo, reka nanje niiraate. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Mwishiimira kwihangaanira abapfaapfa kuko mwebwe muri abanyabwenge. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Mwihangaanira ubashira mu bubaata, cangwa akabarimanganya, cangwa akabashira heejuru, cangwa akabakubita inshi. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ariko nje binteera isoni kuvuga yuuko twabigizemo intege nke!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Icakora ico abandi bantu batiinyuuka, nanje naaciiraatana kandi na noone ibi mbivuze nk'umupfaapfa. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Mbese si Abaheburaayo? Nanje ndi we. Mbese ni Abiisirayeli? Nanje ndi we. Mbese kandi bakomooka kuri Aburahamu? Dore nanje mukomookaho. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Iby 16:23</ref>.</char></note>Mbese ni abaheereza ba Kristo? Nooneho reka mvuge nk'umusazi ariko ndabasumba boose. Nabarushije kugira umuhaati wo gukora, mbarusha inshuro nshizwe mu gihome, mbarusha gukubitwa inkoni nyinshi, ndetse mbarusha no kuba narageze mu kaaga kenshi haburaho gato ngo mpfe. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Abayuuda bankubise inkoni mirongo itatu n'icenda inshuro itaanu. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Iby 16:22</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:19">Iby 14:19</ref>.</char></note>Bankubitiishije ibibando gatatu. Banteeye amabuye rimwe. Narohamye gatatu ndetse mara ijoro n'amanywa mu nyanja hagati. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Iby 9:23</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:5">Iby 14:5</ref>.</char></note>Mu ngendo nyinshi, akenshi nagwaga mu kaaga gateewe n'imyuzure, ngahuura n'abambuzi, beene waacu bakanshira mu kaaga, abanyamahanga bakanshira mu kaaga, ngahuura n'akaaga ngeze mu matawuni makuru, ngahuurira n'akaaga mu butaayu, ku nyanja, ndetse nagize n'akaaga gateewe n'abiiyita abavandimwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Narakoze caane ndavunika, kenshi ndaara ntaryamye, ngira inzara n'imyota, akenshi nkabura ico ndya, ico kwambara, nkagira n'imbeho nyinshi. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Uretse ibindi byose, uko bwije n'uko bukeeye ishaka mfitiye amatoorero rinteera guhora mpagaritse umutima. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Iyo hagize uciika intege, bituma nanje nciika intege, kandi iyo hagize ugwa mu caaha binteera agahinda.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Niiba nkwiriye kwiraata reero, niraatiisha iby'intege nke zanje. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Imaana ari we Se w'Umwami Yesu izi ko ntabeesha na hato, isingizwe iteeka. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Iby 9:23-25</ref>.</char></note>Ubwo nari ndi i Damasiko, umutegetsi utegekwa n'umwami Aretasi yashizeho abarinzi bo kurinda iyo tawuni kugira ngo bamfate, <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />ariko banshira mu giteebo maze baraanyambutsa baanyujije mu dirisha bandenza uruzitiro, nuuko ndahunga mukira ntyo. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul is made to escape through the window" file="CN01937b.TIF" size="col" copy="David Cook NT" ref="11:33">Batorotsa Pawulo</figure><verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kubonekerwa no Guhishuurirwa kwa Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Birakwiye yuuko niiraata nuubwo bitagira ico bimara. Noone reka mbabwire ibyo neeretswe n'ibyo nahishuuriwe n'Umwami waacu. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Hari umuntu nzi wizeera Kristo wazaamuuwe, akagezwa mu ijuru rya gatatu, imyaka cumi n'enye ishize. Icakora sinzi neeza niiba yari mu mubiri cangwa ataari mu mubiri. Imaana yoonyine ni yo ibiizi. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Kandi nzi yuuko uwo muntu, yaaba ari mu mubiri, cangwa atari mu mubiri, Imaana yoonyine niyo ibiizi, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />yazaamuuwe akajanwa muri Paradizo akumva ibitavugwa, ndetse ntaamuntu wemerewe kubisubiramo. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Umuntu nk'uwo ni we naakwiraatana, naho njeewe ubwanje nta kindi nakwiraatana keretse intege nke zanje. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Icakora nshaatse kwiraata, sinaaba nd'umupfaapfa, kuko naaba ndi kuvuga ukuri. Ariko singiiye gukora ntyo kugira ngo hatagira unteekerezaho ibirenze ibyo abona nkora cangwa ibyo yumva mvuga.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Kandi kugira ngo ntaaza guteerwa no kwishira heejuru nkarenza ibikwiriye biteewe n'ibintu nahishuuriwe bitangaaje bityo, nashizwemo igisa nk'ubusabwe bw'umushuubi mu mubiri kimbeera nk'intumwa ya Sataani yo kumbabaza birenze kugira ngo niirinde kwishira heejuru. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ibyo byatumye nsaba Nyagasani gatatu koose kugira ngo abinkize, <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />ariko arambwira ati, “Ubuntu ngira buraguhaagije, kuko imbaraga zanje zuuzurira ahari intege nke.” Niyo mpamvu reero niiraatiisha intege nke zanje neezeerewe, kugira ngo imbaraga za Kristo zituure muri nje. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Bityo nkaba nyuzwe igihe coose nkorera Kristo haaba mu ntege nke, mu bitutsi, mu bikomeye, mu gutootezwa no mu byago kuko nzi neeza yuuko iyo mbaaye umunyantege nke ni bwo ndushaho kugira imbaraga.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Ahagarika Umutima ku bw'Abakristo b'i Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Dore mpindutse umupfaapfa! Ariko nimwe mwabimpase. Kuko ibyari bikwiriye nuuko aba ari mwe mwakanshimye. Nuubwo ari nta co ndi co, za ntumwa mushiimagiza ntaaco zindusha. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Ibimenyeetso hamwe n'ibitangaaza bihamya yuuko ndi intumwa nabikoreye muri mwe niihangaana ubudahinyuka. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Mbese ni iki nakoreye andi matoorero ya Kristo co ntaabakoreye uretse ko ntaashaatse kubarusha? Nimumbabarire niiba ibyo byarababeereye ikibazo.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Ngaho reero ubu niiteguuye kuuza iwaanyu ubwa gatatu. Kandi sinzaabagoora, kuko sinshaaka ibyanyu ahuubwo nimwe nshaaka. Kuko abaana si bo bakwiriye gukenuura ababyeyi ahuubwo ababyeyi ni bo bakwiriye gukenuura abaana baabo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Naashiimiishwa no guhara ibyo mfite byose ku bwanyu, nanje ubwanje nkiitanga kugira ngo mbafashe. Mbese urukundo munkunda rwarushaho kugabanyuka kandi nje mbakunda birenze?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Nyamara mureemera yuuko ntiigeze mbarusha. Ariko bamwe bavuga ko nabaciiye ubwenge, nkabashuka mbashira mu mutego w'ibinyoma. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Mbese koko hari ubwo niigeze mbacura ubwenge nyuriye mu bo noohereje? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ninginze Tito kuuza iwaanyu, ari na wa muvandimwe. Mbese haaba hari inyungu Tito yabashaatsemo? Mbese ntitwakoraga n'umutima uhuuje kandi dufite ikigendererwa kimwe?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Ahaari mwibwira yuuko twaba tumaze iki gihe coose tubiireguuraho. Oya! Ahuubwo tuvugira imbere y'Imaana ibyo Kristo ashaaka kandi ibyo dukora byose nshuti dukunda, tubikora ngo bibuubake. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Kuko ndatiinya yuuko ni nza iwaanyu nzaasanga mutandukanye n'uko mbateekereza kandi namwe musange ntahwanye n'uko mwibwira. Mfite ubwoba yuuko nzaabasanga mu ntonganya, mukigirirana ishari, uburaakari no kwikunda, gusebanya no kuzimura, kwiraata hamwe n'imivurungano. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ndatiinya ko Imaana yanje izankoza isoni imbere yaanyu ikindi gihe ningaruka, bikanteera kuririra abaacumuye mu gihe caashize bakaba batari biihana ubukozi bw'ibibi bwabo bw'irari n'ubusambanyi.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Amabwiriza ya Nyuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Ubu ni ubwa gatatu ngiiye kuuza kubasuura, kandi nk'uko ibyanditswe bivuga ngo, “Urubanza rwose rukemurwa n'ubuhamya bw'abantu babiri cangwa batatu.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Nari nariihanangirije abo boose baari baaracumuye hamwe n'abandi boose ubwo nabasuuraga ubwa kabiri, kandi na noone mbisubiyemo tutari kumwe yuuko ningaruka ntazaabiihangaanira. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Muzaabona ibyemezo byose mwifuuza bihamya yuuko iyo mvuga aba ari Kristo umvugiramo, kandi si umunyatenge nke igihe abakoreeramo ahuubwo abagaragarizamo ububaasha bwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Kuko yabambwe ku musaraba bishingiye ku ntege nke, ariko noone ni muzima ku bw'imbaraga z'Imaana. Naatwe turi abanyantege nke nk'uko Kristo yari ari, nyamara mu gihe Kristo adukoreramo tuzaagaragarizwa imbaraga z'Imaana.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Nuuko reero mwisuuzume ubwanyu kandi mwigerageze mureebe niiba mugikomereye mu kwizeera. Mbese ntimuuzi neeza yuuko Kristo aba muri mwe? Keretse ahaari mubaaye mwaraguuye! <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ariko niizeera yuuko muzaasanga tutaraatsindwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Kandi turabasengera kugira ngo hatagira ikibi mukora, kitagamije kwerekana ko mwatsinze iryo suuzuma, ariko tugendereye kugira ngo mukore ibishitse nuubwo twe twaba nk'abatsinzwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Kuko ari ntaaco tubaasha gukora kidashingiye ku kuri keretse gushigikira ukuri kw'Imaana. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Turaneezeerwa iyo dufite intege nke naho mwe mugakomera. Nuuko tukabasengera ngo mutunganywe rwose. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ni co gitumye mbandikira ntari kumwe namwe, kugira ngo nindamuka nje iwaanyu ntazaakoreesha ubukana mu bubaasha nahaawe na Nyagasani bwo kubuubaka atari ubwo kubaseenya.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umusoozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ahasigaye bavandimwe, murabeho. Mutungaane rwose kandi mukurikize ibyo mbasaba, mwumviikane, mubaane amahoro, nuuko Imaana idukunda kandi igatanga amahoro ibaane namwe.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Muramukanye indamutso yeera.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Abantu b'Imaana boose barabataasha. <verse eid="2CO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Ubuntu bw'Umwami waacu Yesu Kristo, n'urukundo rw'Imaana, no gusangira Umwuka Weera bibaane namwe mwese.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>